---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageStyles from '../../components/PageStyles.astro';
---

<Layout
  lang="en"
  title="Natural capital opportunities | Territorium Capital"
  description="Opportunities to increase territorial profitability through funding, carbon markets and biodiversity markets."
  canonicalPath="/en/opportunities/"
  alternateEsPath="/oportunidades/"
>
  <PageStyles />

  <main>
    <section class="seo-page-hero seo-page-hero--opportunities">
      <div class="seo-page-hero__inner">
        <span class="section-kicker section-kicker--light">Opportunities</span>
        <h1>Opportunities to increase territorial profitability.</h1>
        <p>
          We assess whether a territory can access funding, carbon markets or
          biodiversity markets through a clear view of eligibility, potential
          value and next steps.
        </p>
        <div class="seo-page-hero__actions">
          <a class="seo-cta seo-cta--solid" href="#funding">View opportunities</a>
          <a class="seo-cta" href="/en/services/">View services</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="seo-section seo-section--white">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="section-kicker">Three pathways</span>
          <h2>From territorial data to a defensible opportunity.</h2>
          <p>
            Not every territory fits every pathway. Our work is to identify
            where a real opportunity exists, what it requires and whether it is
            worth pursuing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="seo-card-grid">
          <a class="seo-card" href="#funding">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Access to funding</h3>
            <p>Your territory may be leaving public funding on the table.</p>
          </a>
          <a class="seo-card" href="#carbon">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Access to carbon markets</h3>
            <p>We assess eligibility, technical potential, risks and financial viability.</p>
          </a>
          <a class="seo-card" href="#biodiversity">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Access to biodiversity markets</h3>
            <p>We identify whether the territory can generate measurable, defensible improvement.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="seo-section" id="funding">
      <div class="container seo-two-col">
        <div>
          <span class="section-kicker">01 · Funding</span>
          <h2>Your territory may be leaving public funding on the table.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="seo-copy">
          <p>
            Calls open and close quickly. Between European funds,
            agri-environmental schemes, insurance, energy, digitalisation,
            restoration and regional programmes, opportunities are often missed
            because they arrive too late or because eligibility is unclear.
          </p>
          <p>
            Territorium turns that noise into a practical decision: which calls
            fit the asset, what estimated value they may bring, what information
            is required and whether it is worth applying.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="seo-section seo-section--white">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span class="section-kicker">What you receive</span>
          <h2>A monthly report with real opportunities.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="seo-card-grid seo-card-grid--four">
          <article class="seo-card">
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Timely alerts</h3>
            <p>Relevant opportunities before deadlines are already too close.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="seo-card">
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Only what fits</h3>
            <p>Cross-checking with asset data: location, surface area, uses, crops and constraints.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="seo-card">
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Clear recommendation</h3>
            <p>Eligibility, estimated value, required documentation and whether to apply or not.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="seo-card">
            <span>04</span>
            <h3>Full execution</h3>
            <p>When an opportunity is worth pursuing, we support the file, submission and follow-up.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="regenera-analysis" id="carbon">
      <div class="container regenera-analysis__grid">
        <div class="regenera-analysis__media">
          <img src="/imagenes/medidas/nuevas/conectividad-bosque.jpg" alt="Forest territory assessed for carbon market opportunities">
        </div>
        <div class="regenera-analysis__copy">
          <span class="section-kicker">02 · Carbon</span>
          <h2>Access to carbon markets with technical and financial discipline.</h2>
          <p>
            We assess whether a territory may fit carbon schemes linked to
            restoration, forest management, soil or improved practices, avoiding
            claims that cannot be technically supported.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Compliance and eligibility.</strong> We review fit, additionality, permanence, risks and measurement requirements.</li>
            <li><strong>Financial projections.</strong> We estimate order of magnitude, costs, timing and return sensitivity.</li>
            <li><strong>Support.</strong> We prepare the roadmap to structure, measure and present the project.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="seo-section seo-section--white" id="biodiversity">
      <div class="container seo-two-col">
        <div>
          <span class="section-kicker">03 · Biodiversity</span>
          <h2>Access to biodiversity markets when real improvement can be measured.</h2>
        </div>
        <ul class="seo-list">
          <li><strong>Compliance and eligibility.</strong> We analyse baseline, improvement potential, constraints and fit with emerging methodologies.</li>
          <li><strong>Financial projections.</strong> We estimate restoration, monitoring and maintenance costs, as well as the potential value of generated improvement.</li>
          <li><strong>Support.</strong> We design the technical and commercial route to turn ecological improvement into communicable evidence.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="regenera-disclaimer">
      <div class="container">
        <p>
          Territorium does not guarantee funding approval or monetisation in
          environmental markets. Its role is to detect fit, prioritise
          opportunities and build a technically and financially responsible
          decision.
        </p>
        <a href="/contacto/" class="seo-cta">Discuss an opportunity</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
